[00:05.85] My love must be a kind of blind love
[00:11.90] I can't see anyone but you
[00:28.76] Are the stars out tonight?
[00:44.20] I don't know if it's cloudy or bright
[00:50.89] I only have eyes for you, dear
[01:09.77] The moon may be high
[01:17.28] But I can't see a thing in the sky
[01:23.27] I only have eyes for you
[01:41.82] I don't know if we're in a garden
[01:58.32] Or on a crowded avenue
[02:14.97] You are here and so am I
[02:22.97] Maybe millions of people go by
[02:28.94] But they all disappear from view
[02:44.16] And I only have eyes for you
[03:03.11] 